{"id":"5646","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5646_main_altocumulus-castellanus-radiatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>可见几个长列的高积云似乎在向地平线附近的一个点汇聚（辐辏状云类）。斜侧可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">在共同水平云底中出现的一些角塔</span>。冷锋和高空扰动导致当天早些时候出现局部降雨。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Barry Chan","location":"中国，香港，西贡","latitude":"纬度: 22° 23' 1'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 16' 15'' E","date":"17 January 2016 1735 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 8, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.4"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5646_syn_altocumulus-castellanus-radiatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>中国香港西北方向的冷锋在当天移向近海。第二天的温度下降了5 °C。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5646_upper_altocumulus-castellanus-radiatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>照片拍摄后2.5小时进行的探测显示出在2800米处的高湿度层和不稳定性，这表明是堡状高积云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4722_main_altocumulus-castellanus-radiatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">角塔形的积云状云塔</span>使这个云具有锯齿状的外观（云种为堡状）。积云状云簇的高度比宽度高，它们有一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">共同的水平云底</span>，并且以平行的带（辐状云类）的形式排列。这些云塔可能会继续发展并向浓积云过渡，因为其中一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云带的发展看起来很重要</span>，不幸的是在最显著的位置被云掩盖住了。 </p>\n<p>云底显得太高而不能成为层积云，附近的高空探测和英国英格兰Dunkeswell机场的观测证实了这一点。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jim Galvin","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国德文郡埃克塞特","latitude":"纬度: 50° 43' 35'' N","longitude":"经度: 3° 28' 31'' W","date":"02 August 2015 1943 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 8, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.4"}]}]}